        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AQ-E4, Sonoma Lever with Matching Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion's Sonoma Leverset has a rustic feel that makes it a great choice for ranch-style homes. As the name suggests, this lever and rose combination features design elements that grant it a southwestern feel. Choose from antique pewter, medium bronze, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Fusion AQ-E4 Sonoma Lever with Matching Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors that have either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AQ-E4 Sonoma Lever with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Sonoma Collection Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sonoma Leverset, Fusion AQ-E4",
                "description": "Sonoma Lever and Rose Fusion AQ-E4 - Fusion's Sonoma Leverset has a rustic feel that makes it a great choice for ranch-style homes. As the name suggests, this lever and rose combination features design elements that grant it a southwestern feel. Choose from antique pewter, medium bronze, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Fusion AQ-E4 Sonoma Lever with Matching Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors that have either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
